hadiths[34]{hadithnumber,text}:
"146","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hamein hadith sunai, unhonne kaha: Mu'adh bin Hisham ne hamein hadith sunai, unhonne kaha: Mere waalid ne mujhe hadith sunai, Yunus se, Qatadah se, Anas bin Malik se, unhonne kaha: Nabi Allah ne na toh khawan par khaya, na kisi sukurja mein, aur na unke liye patli rotee pakai gayi. Kaha: Maine Qatadah se pucha: Phir ye log kya khate thay? Kaha: In sufraon par. Muhammad bin Bashshar ne kaha: Jo Yunus Qatadah se riwayat karte hain wo Yunus Iskaf hain."
"147","[AI-translation] Ahmad bin Mani' ne hamein hadith sunai, unhonne kaha: Abbad bin Abbad Al-Muhallabi ne hamein hadith sunai, Mujalid se, Ash-Sha'bi se, Masruq se, unhonne kaha: Main Aisha ke paas dakhil hua, toh unhone mere liye khana mangwaya aur farmaya: Main khane se pet nahi bhar sakti, pas agar main chaahun ke roon toh main roti hoon. Kaha: Maine pucha: Kyun? Unhone kaha: Main us haal ko yaad karti hoon jis mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne duniya ko choda, Allah ki qasam! Unhone ek hi din mein do martaba rotee aur gosht se pet nahi bhara."
"148","[AI-translation] Mahmud bin Ghaylan ne hamein hadith sunai, unhonne kaha: Abu Dawud ne hamein hadith sunai, unhonne kaha: Shu'bah ne hamein hadith sunai, Abu Ishaq se, unhonne kaha: Maine Abdur-Rahman bin Yazid ko hadith sunate suna, Al-Aswad bin Yazid se, Aisha se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jau ki rotee se lagatar do din tak pet bhar ke nahi khaye jab tak unka intiqal nahi ho gaya."
"149","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abdur-Rahman ne hamein hadith sunai, unhonne kaha: Abdullah bin Amr Abu Ma'mar ne hamein hadith sunai, Abd al-Warith ne hamein hadith sunai, Sa'id bin Abi Arubah se, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhonne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne khawan par nahi khaya, aur na patli rotee khayi jab tak unki wafat nahi ho gayi."
"150","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Sahl bin Askar aur Abdullah bin Abdur-Rahman ne hamein hadith sunai, dono ne kaha: Yahya bin Hassan ne hamein hadith sunai, unhonne kaha: Sulaiman bin Bilal ne hamein hadith sunai, Hisham bin Urwah se, inke waalid se, Aisha se, unka riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sirkah kya behtareen salan hai. Abdullah bin Abdur-Rahman ne apni riwayat mein kaha: Kya behtareen salan hai ya sirkah behtareen salan hai."
"151","[AI-translation] Hamein Qutaibah ne hadees bayaan ki, unhonne kaha: Hamein Abu Al-Ahwasi ne hadees bayaan ki, Simak bin Harb se, unhonne kaha: Maine An-Nu'man bin Bashir ko yeh kehte hue suna: Kya tum aise khane aur peene mein nahi ho jo chaho? Main ne tumhare Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha hai, aur unhein daqal (khajoor) se pet bharne ke liye bhi nahi milta tha."
"152","[AI-translation] Hamein Abda bin Abdullah Al-Khuza'i ne hadees bayaan ki, unhonne kaha: Hamein Muawiya bin Hisham ne hadees bayaan ki, Sufyan se, Muharib bin Dithar se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhonne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Siraqa behtareen saalan (ghiza) hai."
"153","[AI-translation] Hamein Hannad ne hadees bayaan ki, Hamein Waki' ne hadees bayaan ki, Sufyan se, Ayyub se, Abu Qilaba se, Zahdam Al-Jarmi se, kehne lage: Hum Abu Musa Al-Ash'ari ke paas the, pas unhein murghi ka gosht laaya gaya, toh qaum mein se ek shakhs ek taraf ho gaya. Unhone pucha: Tumhara kya hai? Usne kaha: Maine usey kuch khate hue dekha, isliye maine qasam kha li hai ke main isey nahi khaunga."
"154","[AI-translation] Hum se hadith riwayat ki Fadl bin Sahl Al-A'raj Al-Baghdadi ne, kaha: Hum se hadith riwayat ki Ibrahim bin Abdur-Rahman bin Mahdi ne, Ibrahim bin Umar bin Safina se, un ke waalid se, un ke dada se, kaha: Maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke sath hubara (aik qisam ka parindah) ka gosht khaya."
"155","[AI-translation] Hum se hadith riwayat ki Ali bin Hujr ne, kaha: Hum se hadith riwayat ki Ismail bin Ibrahim ne, Ayyub se, Qasim Tamimi se, Zahdam Jarmi se, kaha: Hum Abu Musa Ash'ari ke paas the. Unhon ne apna khana pesh kiya, aur apne khane mein murgi ka gosht pesh kiya, aur majlis mein Bani Taim-Allah ka ek aadmi tha, surkh rang ka goya ke koi mawla (ghulam) ho. Kaha: Woh qareeb nahi aaya to Abu Musa ne us se kaha: Qareeb aa, kyunki maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko ise khate hue dekha hai. Us ne kaha: Maine ise kuch khate hue dekha to mujhe ghin aayi, pas maine qasam kha li ke main ise hargiz nahi khaunga."
"156","[AI-translation] Hum se hadith riwayat ki Mahmud bin Ghaylan ne, kaha: Hum se hadith riwayat ki Abu Ahmad Zubairi aur Abu Nu'aim ne, dono ne kaha: Hum se hadith riwayat ki Sufyan ne, Abdullah bin Isa se, Sham ke ek aadmi se jisay Ata kaha jata hai, Abu Usaid se, kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Zaitun ka tel khao aur is se malish karo, be-shak woh barkat wale darakht se hai."
"157","[AI-translation] Hamein Yahya bin Musa ne hadith sunayi, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdur Razzaq ne hadith sunayi, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ma'mar ne hadith sunayi, Zaid bin Aslam se, unse unke walid se, aur unse Umar bin al-Khattab se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Zaitun ka tail khao aur us se malish karo, beshak yeh barkat wale darakht se hai."
"158","[AI-translation] Haddasana As-Sinji aur woh Abu Dawud Sulaiman bin Ma'bad As-Sinji hain, farmaye: Haddasana Abd-ur-Razzaq, Ma'mar se, Zaid bin Aslam se, unke walid se, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se is ki tarah, aur unhon ne is mein Umar ka zikr nahi kiya."
"159","[AI-translation] Hamain Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hadith sunayi, kehne lage: Hamain Muhammad bin Jafar aur Abdur Rahman bin Mehdi ne hadith sunayi, dono kehte hain: Hamain Shu'ba ne, Qatada se, Anas bin Malik se riwayat kiya, kehte hain: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dubba (kaddoo) pasand tha. Pas khaana pesh kiya gaya, ya unhe dawat di gayi, to main us (kaddoo) ko talash karta aur un ke saamne rakh deta, kyunke mujhe maloom tha ke woh usay pasand karte hain."
"160","[AI-translation] Hamay Qutaibah bin Sa'id ne hadith sunayi, unhon ne kaha: Hamay Hafs bin Ghiyath ne hadith sunayi, Isma'il bin Abi Khalid se, Hakim bin Jabir se, apne walid se. Unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ke paas dakhil hua, toh maine dekha ke unke paas kaddu kata ja raha hai. Maine pucha: Yeh kya hai? Aap sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum is se apne khane mein izafa karte hain."
"161","[AI-translation] Hamay Qutaibah bin Sa'id ne hadees sunayi, unhonne Malik bin Anas se, unhonne Ishaq bin 'Abdullah bin Abi Talha se, ke unhone Anas bin Malik ko kehte hue suna: Ek darzi ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ko apne banaye hue khaane ki dawat di. Anas ne kaha: Toh main Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ke saath us khaane par gaya, toh Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ke saamne jau ki roti aur aash jismein kaddu aur qadeed (sookha gosht) tha paish kiya gaya. Anas ne kaha: Toh mainne Nabi (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke woh lagan ke idhar-udhar kaddu talash kar rahe hain, toh us din se main kaddu se muhabbat karne laga."
"162","[AI-translation] Hamay Ahmad bin Ibrahim Ad-Dawraqi, Salamah bin Shabib, aur Mahmud bin Ghaylan ne hadees sunayi, unhonne kaha: Hamay Abu Usamah ne hadees sunayi, unhonne Hisham bin 'Urwah se, unhonne apne waalid se, unhonne 'Ayesha se, unhonne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) halwa aur shehad se muhabbat rakhte the."
"163","[AI-translation] Hamay Al-Hasan bin Muhammad Az-Za'farani ne kaha: Hamay Al-Hajjaj bin Muhammad ne hadees sunayi, unhonne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: Mujhe Muhammad bin Yusuf ne khabar di, ke 'Ata bin Yasar ne unhein khabar di, ke Umm-e-Salama ne unhein khabar di, ke unhone Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ke saamne bhuna hua jamb (pahar) paish kiya, toh Aap (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne us mein se khaaya, phir namaz ke liye uthe, aur wuzu na farmaya."
"164","[AI-translation] Hamay Qutaibah ne kaha: Hamay Ibn Lahi'ah ne hadees sunayi, unhonne Sulaiman bin Ziyad se, unhonne 'Abdullah bin Al-Harith se, unhone kaha: Hum ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ke saath masjid mein shiwa (kabab) khaaya."
"165","[AI-translation] Hamay Mahmud bin Ghaylan ne kaha: Hamay Waki' ne hadees sunayi, unhonne kaha: Hamay Mis'ar ne hadees sunayi, Abu Sakhrah Jam'i bin Shaddad se, unhonne Al-Mughirah bin 'Abdullah se, unhone Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, unhone kaha: Ek raat main Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ke saath mehman tha, toh bhuna hua jamb (pahar) laaya gaya. Phir Aap (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne chaku utha liya aur kaatne lage, toh us se mere liye kaata. Unhone kaha: Phir Bilal namaz ki ittila dene ke liye aaye, toh Aap (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne chaku rakh diya aur farmaya: Iske haathon ko kya hua, mitti mile? Unhone kaha: Aur unki mochhe poori ho chuki thin, toh Aap (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne unse farmaya: Kya main aapke liye miswaak par kaat doon, ya aap miswaak par kaat lein?"
"166","[AI-translation] Hamein Wasil bin 'Abdul A'la ne hadees sunayi, kaha: Hamein Muhammad bin Fudayl ne hadees sunayi, Abu Hayyan Taymi se, Abu Zur'a se, Abu Hurayra se, kehte hain ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas gosht laya gaya, toh aap ki taraf bazoo uthaya gaya, aur aap ko wo pasand tha, toh aap ne us mein se kaata."
"167","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Bishar ne hadees sunayi, kaha: Hamein Abu Dawud ne hadees sunayi, Zuhair yaani Ibn Muhammad se, Abu Ishaq se, Sa'd bin Iyaz se, Ibn Mas'ud se, kehte hain ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko bazoo pasand tha. Kaha: aur bazoo mein zeher diya gaya, aur aap yeh samajhte the ke yahudion ne unhein zeher diya."
"168","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Bishar ne hadees sunayi, kaha: Hamein Muslim bin Ibrahim ne hadees sunayi, kaha: Hamein Aban bin Yazeed ne hadees sunayi, Qatada se, Shahr bin Hawshab se, Abu 'Ubaida se, kehte hain ke: Maine Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke liye degchi pakaayi, aur aap ko bazoo pasand tha, toh maine unhein bazoo nawaali, phir aap ne farmaya: mujhe bazoo do, toh maine nawaali, phir farmaya: mujhe bazoo do, toh main ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, bakri ke kitne bazoo hote hain? Toh aap ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, agar tum khamosh rehte toh jitni dafa main mangta, tum mujhe bazoo deta rehta."
"169","[AI-translation] Hamein Hasan bin Muhammad Za'farani ne hadees sunayi, kaha: Hamein Yahya bin 'Abbad ne hadees sunayi, Fulaeh bin Sulaiman se, kaha: Mujhe bani 'Abbad ke ek shakhs ne, jisay Abdul Wahab bin Yahya bin 'Abbad kaha jata hai, hadees sunayi, Abdullah bin Zubair se, Aisha se, kehti hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko gosht mein bazoo sab se zyada mehboob nahi tha, lekin aap gosht ek din chhor kar hi paate the, aur aap uski taraf jaldi karte the kyunke wo sab se jaldi pakti thi."
"170","[AI-translation] Hamein Mahmood bin Ghaylan ne hadees sunayi, kaha: Hamein Abu Ahmad ne hadees sunayi, kaha: Hamein Mis'ar ne hadees sunayi, kaha: Maine Fahm (qabeele) ke ek shaykh se suna, kaha: Maine Abdullah bin Ja'far ko kehte suna: Maine Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate suna: Be-shak sab se mazedaar gosht pusht ka gosht hai."
"171","[AI-translation] Hambe na Sufyan bin Waki', kehne lage: Hambe na Zaid bin Al-Hubab, 'Abdullah bin Al-Mu'ammal se, Ibn Abi Mulaika se, 'Aisha se: Ke Nabi (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya khoob salan hai sirka."
"172","[AI-translation] Hambe na Abu Kuraib Muhammad bin Al-'Ala', kehne lage: Hambe na Abu Bakr bin 'Ayyash, Thabit Abi Hamzah Al-Thumali se, Al-Sha'bi se, Umm Hani se, kehne lagi: Nabi (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) mere paas aaye, to farmaya: Kya tumhare paas kuch hai? Maine kaha: Nahi, magar khushk roti aur sirka. To farmaya: Lao, jis ghar mein sirka ho wo khali nahi."
"173","[AI-translation] Hambe na Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna, kehne lage: Hambe na Muhammad bin Ja'far, kehne lage: Hambe na Shu'bah, 'Amr bin Murrah se, Murrah Al-Hamdani se, Abi Musa Al-Ash'ari se, Nabi (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) se, farmaya: 'Aisha ka fadl aurton par usi tarah hai jaisa Tharid ka fadl baqi saari khoraakion par."
"174","[AI-translation] Hambe na 'Ali bin Hujr, kehne lage: Hambe na Isma'il bin Ja'far, kehne lage: Hambe na 'Abdullah bin 'Abd al-Rahman bin Ma'mar Al-Ansari Abu Tuwalah, ke unhone Anas bin Malik ko suna kehte hue: Rasool Allah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Aisha ka fadl aurton par usi tarah hai jaisa Tharid ka fadl baqi saari khoraakion par."
"175","[AI-translation] Hambe na Qutaibah bin Sa'id, kehne lage: Hambe na 'Abd al-'Aziz bin Muhammad, Suhail bin Abi Salih se, unke waalid se, Abu Hurairah se, ke unhone Rasool Allah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ko dekha, ke unhone aqit (khushk dahi) ka thaur kha kar wuzu kiya, phir unhone dekha ke ek bakri ke kandhe ka gosht kha kar namaaz padhi, aur wuzu na kiya."
"176","[AI-translation] Hamein Ibn Abi Umar ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hadith bayan ki, Wail bin Dawood se, unke bete, yaani Bakr bin Wail se, Zuhri se, Anas bin Malik se, kehne lage: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Safiyyah ke sath khajoor aur sawiq se walima kiya."
"177","[AI-translation] Hamein Husain bin Muhammad Basri ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Fudail bin Sulaiman ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Faid ne hadith bayan ki, jo Ubaidullah bin Ali bin Abi Rafi' ke ghulam the, jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ghulam the, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ubaidullah bin Ali ne hadith bayan ki apni dadi Salma se, ke Hasan bin Ali, Ibn Abbas aur Ibn Jafar un ke paas aaye aur un se kaha: Hamare liye woh khana banao jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko pasand hota tha aur aap acchi tarah khaya karte the. Unhon ne kaha: Aey mere bete, aaj us ki khwahish nahi hai. Unhon ne kaha: Balke hamare liye banao. Unhon ne kaha: Woh uthi, thori jo (barley) le kar pisi, phir usey deg (qadr) mein rakh diya, aur us par thora tel daala, aur fulful aur tawabil pees kar daale, phir un ke paas la kar pesh kiya aur kaha: Yeh woh hai jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko pasand hota tha aur aap acchi tarah khaya karte the."
"178","[AI-translation] Hamein Mahmud bin Ghailan ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Abu Ahmad ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sufyan ne hadith bayan ki, Aswad bin Qais se, Nubaih Anazi se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, kehne lage: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamare ghar mein hamare paas aaye, hum ne un ke liye ek bakri zibh ki, toh aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Goya unhein maloom hai ke hum gosht pasand karte hain. Aur is hadith mein ek qissa hai."
"179","[AI-translation] Hamein Ibn Abi Umar ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sufyan ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel ne hadith bayan ki, unhone Jabir (raziallahu anhu) ko suna. Sufyan ne kaha: Aur hamein Muhammad bin Munkadir ne hadith bayan ki, Jabir (raziallahu anhu) se, kehne lage: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam nikle, aur main un ke sath tha. Aap ek ansari aurat ke paas dakhil hue, us ne un ke liye ek bakri zibh ki. Aap ne us mein se khaya, aur us ne aap ke paas ek qina (thal) rutab (pake hue khajoor) ka laya, aap ne us mein se khaya. Phir aap zuhr ke liye wuzu kiye aur namaz padhi, sallallahu alaihi wa sallam, phir aap laut aaye. Us ne aap ke paas us bakri ki ullah (baqiya gusht) mein se ek tukra laya, aap ne khaya, phir asr ki namaz padhi, aur wuzu nahi kiya."
